; Intentionally minimal.
;
; NOTE: On the local BT machine, Node/npm must trust the corporate CA or network
; calls fail with UNABLE_TO_GET_ISSUER_CERT_LOCALLY. Do NOT put
; `node-options=--use-system-ca` here: it would be picked up by cloud CI builds
; (Cloudflare/Netlify/GitHub Actions) where that flag is unnecessary and can
; break the build. Instead, set it locally per-shell when running scripts:
;   $env:NODE_OPTIONS = "--use-system-ca"   (PowerShell, this machine only)
; or export it in your shell profile.
